id he wants to pay them  more but until additional funding comes  through times will continue to be tough  for teachers most my teacher friends who  don't have a husband support or a  spousal supported income have two and  three jobs that they work just to pay  bills and that's not right for CBS this  morning Saturday Carter Evans Los  Angeles I hate to see this there is  nothing more important yeah your kid's  life than a great teacher and we wish  them strength in their in their battle  ahead
 

